{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406890/extras/title\u7528\u9014EN_01.png?t=1744815898\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Includes: main Chapter (10 chapters), side stages, special stages, challenge stages, Clearance Bonus, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each chapter contains about 5-6 main stages;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406890/extras/title\u7528\u9014EN_02.png?t=1744815898\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The main characters are \u300c<strong>the Embodiment of Scarlet Devil</strong>\u300d; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">more characters will join as the main story progresses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than 30 characters can be used finally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406890/extras/title\u7528\u9014EN_03.png?t=1744815898\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cultivation includes: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">character upgrade, character talent, weapon proficiency and level, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">weapon skills, equipment .etc...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Through character cultivation, and the combination of different professional cultivation, equipped skills, etc., skill matching is carried out to finally create a hexagonal warrior</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Supports two modes: [Fixed Point Addition] and [Random Point Addition]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406890/extras/title\u7528\u9014EN_04.png?t=1744815898\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In base , you can control the movement of characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The infrastructure and some subsequent gameplay will focus on the base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406890/extras/title\u7528\u9014EN_06.png?t=1744815898\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">About -Class change-, Class-change without appearance change is rasl Class-change . </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So each character will have multiple sets of professional appearances,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please forgive the time cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thank you for your support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3406890?t=1744815898","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3406890?t=1744815898","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406890/7d258ef2cf2bcb249afa183b77afb36ef464916c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744815898","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406890/7d258ef2cf2bcb249afa183b77afb36ef464916c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744815898","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3407110,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406890/extras/title\u7528\u9014EN_01.png?t=1744815898\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Includes: main Chapter (10 chapters), side stages, special stages, challenge stages, Clearance Bonus, etc.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each chapter contains about 5-6 main stages;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406890/extras/title\u7528\u9014EN_02.png?t=1744815898\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The main characters are \u300c<strong>the Embodiment of Scarlet Devil</strong>\u300d; </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">more characters will join as the main story progresses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More than 30 characters can be used finally.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406890/extras/title\u7528\u9014EN_03.png?t=1744815898\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cultivation includes: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">character upgrade, character talent, weapon proficiency and level, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">weapon skills, equipment .etc...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Through character cultivation, and the combination of different professional cultivation, equipped skills, etc., skill matching is carried out to finally create a hexagonal warrior</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Supports two modes: [Fixed Point Addition] and [Random Point Addition]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406890/extras/title\u7528\u9014EN_04.png?t=1744815898\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In base , you can control the movement of characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The infrastructure and some subsequent gameplay will focus on the base.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406890/extras/title\u7528\u9014EN_06.png?t=1744815898\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">About -Class change-, Class-change without appearance change is rasl Class-change . </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">So each character will have multiple sets of professional appearances,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please forgive the time cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thank you for your support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Oct.Works"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406890/cf6c0415f21023f6067080c400549f90ee2894b3/header.jpg?t=1744815898","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"This is a doujin game of Touhou Project.<br />\r\nComply with the Touhou Project Guidelines","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257122792,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257122792/movie480.mp4?t=1744009855","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257122792/movie_max.mp4?t=1744009855"},"name":"demo pv2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257122792/5449394a64ccbbb547f46c9d614c5af7a06b6448/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744009855","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257122792/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744009855","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257122792/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744009855"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257118365,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118365/movie480.mp4?t=1744009249","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118365/movie_max.mp4?t=1744009249"},"name":"Unit Classes in early Game","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257118365/5ea5d1c385a4f43fc505f96ef71f78285abb2e14/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744009249","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118365/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744009249","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118365/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744009249"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257118297,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118297/movie480.mp4?t=1742896258","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118297/movie_max.mp4?t=1742896258"},"name":"\u8bd5